ecording for the tag \"PT101\" with \"on_change\" storage mode. I'll use the enable_history function to do this."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45638, "output_tokens": 151, "latency_ms": 11166.54229996493, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 已成功为 **PT101** 开启历史记录，配置如下：\n\n| 配置项 | 值 |\n|--------|-----|\n| **标签** | PT101 |\n| **状态** | 已启用 |\n| **存储模式** | 变化存储（on_change） |\n\n变化存储模式意味着：当 PT101 的数值发生**超过死区（deadband）范围的变化**时，才会记录一条历史数据，相比周期存储可以更高效地利用存储空间。\n\n如需进一步调整（如设置死区值、保留天数等），请随时告知！", "reasoning": "The history has been successfully enabled for PT101 with on_change storage mode."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 91135, "output_tokens": 252, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18857.41399996914}, "judge": null}
