ext": "好的，我先查一下系统中与冷凝器出口相关的点位和历史记录配置。", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to check the historical trend data for a \"condenser outlet\" (冷凝器出口) and generate a table. Let me first look at what points exist in the system related to this, and what history is configured.\n\nLet me start by listing the points to find any related to condenser outlet, and also list the history configurations."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45685, "output_tokens": 373, "latency_ms": 15097.257899993565, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前系统中的情况如下：\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| SCADA 点位 | **0 个**（尚无任何点位定义） |\n| 历史记录配置 | **0 个**（尚未启用任何历史采样） |\n\n---\n\n### 📌 问题说明\n\n系统里还没有创建\"冷凝器出口\"相关的点位，也没有开启历史数据采集，所以目前无法查询历史 trend 数据。\n\n---\n\n### 🔧 需要您提供以下信息来完成配置：\n\n1. **冷凝器出口的点位 Tag 名称**，例如 `CONDENSER_OUTLET_TEMP`、`CONDENSER_OUTLET_PRESS` 等\n2. **点位类型**（模拟量 analog / 数字量 digital / 字符串 string）\n3. **工程单位**（如 °C、bar、kPa 等）\n4. **量程范围**（min / max）\n5. **历史采样间隔**（如每秒、每 5 秒等）\n6. **数据保留天数**（如 30 天、90 天等）\n\n请告诉我这些信息，我可以帮您：\n1. ✅ 创建冷凝器出口的点位\n2. ✅ 开启历史数据采集\n3. ✅ 查询历史数据并生成表格\n\n您有具体的点位信息吗？", "reasoning": "The system currently has no points defined and no history configurations. I need to let the user know that there's nothing to query yet. I should ask them if they want me to:\n1. Create the condenser outlet point(s) first\n2. Enable history on those points\n3. Then query the data\n\nLet me inform the user about this situation."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 91183, "output_tokens": 492, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22046.833399974275}, "judge": null}
