et. Let me list the points to see what's available."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45662, "output_tokens": 332, "latency_ms": 12639.899700006936, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中 **还没有配置任何点位（tags）**，所以无法查询冷凝器出口的历史趋势数据。\n\n要完成您的需求，我们需要先进行以下几步配置：\n\n1. **创建冷凝器出口的点位**（例如 `CONDENSER_OUTLET_TEMP`）——需要您提供：\n   - 点位名称/标签名\n   - 数据类型（模拟量 analog / 数字量 digital / 字符串 string）\n   - 工程单位（如 °C、°F、kPa 等）\n   - 量程范围（min / max）\n\n2. **启用历史记录**（historian sampling），这样才有趋势数据可查\n\n3. **创建趋势图表**或**生成报告**\n\n---\n\n请问您能提供一下冷凝器出口这个点位的具体信息吗？比如：\n- 这是一个温度点？压力点？还是流量？\n- 标签名想叫什么？（如 `COND_OUTLET_TEMP`）\n- 工程单位和量程范围是多少？\n\n有了这些信息我就能帮您一步步配置好。", "reasoning": "The project has no points configured yet. This means there's no condenser outlet tag to query history from. I need to let the user know that there are currently no points configured in the project, so I can't query historical data or create a trend.\n\nI should inform the user about this and ask if they want me to:\n1. Create the condenser outlet point first\n2. Then enable history for it\n3. Then create a trend group\n\nLet me explain the situation to the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 91160, "output_tokens": 459, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21337.420199997723}, "judge": null}
