ts being created first\n\nSo I need to first create the 3 points, wait for them to complete, then enable history.\n\nLet me create the 3 points first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46067, "output_tokens": 109, "latency_ms": 4801.595400029328, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "三个点位创建成功，现在为它们开启历史采集：", "reasoning": "All 3 points created successfully. Now I need to enable history for each of them."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46285, "output_tokens": 179, "latency_ms": 7057.262500049546, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部完成！已创建 **3 个 AI 点位**并开启历史采集：\n\n| 点位标签 | 类型 | 单位 | 说明 | 历史 |\n|---------|------|------|------|------|\n| TI-201 | analog | °C | Temperature Indicator 201 | ✅ 已开启 |\n| PI-201 | analog | bar | Pressure Indicator 201 | ✅ 已开启 |\n| FI-201 | analog | m³/h | Flow Indicator 201 | ✅ 已开启 |\n\n历史采集默认参数：**周期采样，1秒间隔，30天保留期**。如需调整量程范围（min/max）或历史采样参数，随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "All done. Let me summarize what was created."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 137867, "output_tokens": 746, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 26992.32010002015}, "judge": null}
