g": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.012700038496404886, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:c2c6f084ec267c5d8f6b86c605eff94c847bd464cdc720e9489a9404a9fef9ca", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45512, "output_tokens": 292, "latency_ms": 15768.670100020245, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来为 TI-201 创建 HH（高高）和 LL（低低）两个模拟量报警。这两个操作互相独立，可以同时执行：", "reasoning": "The user wants to create alarm configurations for a temperature indicator TI-201. They want:\n1. A High-High (HH) alarm at 100 with high priority\n2. A Low-Low (LL) alarm at 10 with high priority\n\nI need to create two analog alarms for the tag TI-201. I'll use create_analog_alarm for both:\n1. One alarm with high_limit = 100 (HH)\n2. One alarm with low_limit = 10 (LL)\n\nBoth should have priority set to \"high\".\n\nLet me create both alarms simultaneously since they are independent of each other."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45874, "output_tokens": 173, "latency_ms": 6605.622900009621, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已成功为 **TI-201** 创建两个报警，配置如下：\n\n| 报警 ID | 类型 | 触发值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|------|--------|--------|\n| `alarm_TI201_HH` | 高高 (HH) | ≥ 100 | **High** |\n| `alarm_TI201_LL` | 低低 (LL) | ≤ 10 | **High** |\n\n两个报警均已激活。当 TI-201 的值超过 100 或低于 10 时，将触发高优先级报警。\n\n如需调整死区（deadband）或设置其他报警级别（如 Hi / Lo），请随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workf