击事件（比如启动某个设备或执行脚本），告诉我具体需求，我可以继续帮你设置。", "reasoning": "All done. Let me summarize what was accomplished."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 183427, "output_tokens": 768, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 41112.07390000345}, "judge": null}
