"result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"binding": "pump_b.value=PumpB"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b.bindings.value": "PumpB"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.018099963199347258, "intended_entities": ["pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b.bindings.value"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.pump_station", "pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b", "points.PumpB"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:98327752e448e2768a1d5554e14583a307747a19d68f8b9f81b75d5bd3482296", "final_hash": "sha256:f40325254237eba791b4ddbb3d22eb82b414d052c1e3719529c75f2263737823", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45508, "output_tokens": 288, "latency_ms": 10152.521000010893, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您完成泵站画面的配置。首先创建页面，然后添加泵图元并绑定点位。\n\n**第一步：创建泵站画面**", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create a new HMI page for a pump station (泵站画面)\n2. Add 2 pump widgets on the page\n3. Bind them to PumpA and PumpB points respectively\n\nLet me break this down:\n1. First, I need to create a page for the pump station\n2. Then create 2 pump widgets on that page\n3. Then bind the points to the widgets\n\nLet me start by creating the page first. I'll call create_page with appropriate parameters.\n\nFor the page, I'll use:\n- id: \"pump_station\" \n- name: \"泵站画面\" (Pump Station)\n\nThen I'll create 2 pump widgets. For widgets, I need:\n- page_id\n- widget_id\n- type: \"pump\"\n- position and size\n\nThen bind points to widgets using bind_point.\n\nLet me start with creating the page first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45831, "output_tokens": 318, "latency_ms": 11145.43259999482, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "**第二步：添加2个泵图元**", "reasoning": "Good, the page was created. Now I need to create 2 pump widgets on this page. Let me create them with appropriate positions. I'll place them side by side.\n\nFor the first pump (PumpA):\n- page_id: pump_station\n- widget_id: pump_a\n- type: pump\n- position: [300, 400]\n- size: [200, 200]\n\nFor the second pump (PumpB):\n- page_id: pump_station\n- widget_id: pump_b\n- type: pump\n- position: [700, 400]\n- size: [200, 200]\n\nI can create both widgets at the same time since they're independent."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46212, "output_tokens": 174, "latency_ms": 7906.417099991813, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "**第三步：绑定点位到泵图元**", "reasoning": "Both pump widgets have been created. Now I need to bind the points PumpA and PumpB to the respective widgets. I'll bind them to the \"value\" property of the pump widgets.\n\nI can do both bindings at the same time since they're independent."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46455, "output_tokens": 216, "latency_ms": 8503.964399977122, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "---\n\n✅ **泵站画面配置完成！** 汇总如下：\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | `泵站画面` (ID: `pump_station`, 分辨率 1920×1080) |\n| **泵图元A** | `pump_a`，位置 (300, 400)，绑定点位 `PumpA` |\n| **泵图元B** | `pump_b`，位置 (700, 400)，绑定点位 `PumpB` |\n\n两个泵图元已水平排列在画面中央区域，您可以根据需要进一步：\n- 调整泵的样式（颜色、大小等）\n- 添加文本标签显示泵名称\n- 绑定其他属性（如 `status`、`color` 等）以实现运行状态变色等功能\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All tasks completed successfully. Let me summarize what was done."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 184006, "output_tokens": 996, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 38205.39179997286}, "judge": null}
