"initial_hash": "sha256:98327752e448e2768a1d5554e14583a307747a19d68f8b9f81b75d5bd3482296", "final_hash": "sha256:e0c364c6d4c7fbd2619040b22a81e18e74b38a98f8806f2e8760e0cbf882ba8f", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45508, "output_tokens": 207, "latency_ms": 12633.856699976604, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你完成泵站画面的配置。首先，我需要检查点位 PumpA 和 PumpB 是否已存在，同时查看现有页面列表。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create a new HMI page for a pump station (泵站画面)\n2. Add 2 pump widgets on the page\n3. Bind them to PumpA and PumpB points respectively\n\nLet me first check if the points PumpA and PumpB exist, and also list existing pages to avoid conflicts. I'll do these queries in parallel.\n\nActually, let me think about this step by step:\n1. First, I need to create a page for the pump station\n2. Then create two pump widgets on that page\n3. Then bind the points PumpA and PumpB to the widgets\n\nI should first check if the points exist and if there are any existing pages. Let me do that."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45849, "output_tokens": 171, "latency_ms": 8818.023599975277, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 **PumpA** 和 **PumpB** 已存在（均为 digital 类型），当前无页面。现在开始创建泵站画面和泵图元。", "reasoning": "The points PumpA and PumpB already exist as digital points. There are no existing pages. Now I need to:\n1. Create a pump station page\n2. Create 2 pump widgets on the page\n3. Bind the points to the widgets\n\nLet me create the page first."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46055, "output_tokens": 280, "latency_ms": 9451.199500006624, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面创建成功，现在添加2个泵图元：", "reasoning": "Page created successfully. Now I need to create 2 pump widgets on the page. I'll create them side by side."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46400, "output_tokens": 168, "latency_ms": 6822.304899978917, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个泵图元已创建，现在绑定点位：", "reasoning": "Both pump widgets created successfully. Now I need to bind PumpA to pump_a_widget and PumpB to pump_b_widget."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46639, "output_tokens": 262, "latency_ms": 8664.184599998407, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "所有配置已完成！以下是本次操作的汇总：\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 泵站画面配置完成\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | `泵站画面` (ID: `pump_station`)，分辨率 1920×1080，深色背景 |\n| **泵图元 A** | `pump_a_widget`，位于 (400, 400)，大小 200×200 |\n| **泵图元 B** | `pump_b_widget`，位于 (900, 400)，大小 200×200 |\n| **绑定关系** | `pump_a_widget.value` ← **PumpA** (digital) |\n| | `pump_b_widget.value` ← **PumpB** (digital) |\n\n两个泵图元已水平排列在画面中央，当 PumpA / PumpB 点位状态变化时，泵图元将自动反映运行状态（如绿色=运行，红色=停止）。\n\n如需进一步调整布局、添加管路连线或配置报警，请告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All tasks completed successfully. Let me summarize what was done."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 230451, "output_tokens": 1088, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 47005.414100014605}, "judge": null}
