ection"}, {"name": "execute_sql_query"}, {"name": "set_retention_policy"}, {"name": "list_databases"}, {"name": "get_channel"}, {"name": "get_session"}, {"name": "get_state"}, {"name": "set_buffer"}, {"name": "set_module"}, {"name": "set_backup"}, {"name": "set_screen"}, {"name": "update_config"}, {"name": "update_valve"}, {"name": "update_trigger"}, {"name": "update_protocol"}, {"name": "create_notification_rule"}, {"name": "configure_notification_channel"}, {"name": "add_escalation_level"}, {"name": "test_notification"}, {"name": "list_notification_rules"}, {"name": "get_connection"}, {"name": "get_token"}, {"name": "get_layout"}, {"name": "set_cache"}, {"name": "set_sensor"}, {"name": "set_restore"}, {"name": "set_panel"}, {"name": "update_parameter"}, {"name": "update_pump"}, {"name": "update_schedule"}, {"name": "update_gateway"}], "visible_count": 300, "selected": "list_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "p1", "name": "页面1"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.020899984519928694, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:312befcef3bd35cdc7290e5c0022e0d1e38927b9b62d134974a6c9238000bebd", "final_hash": "sha256:312befcef3bd35cdc7290e5c0022e0d1e38927b9b62d134974a6c9238000bebd", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45501, "output_tokens": 113, "latency_ms": 6745.224000012968, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先了解一下当前项目的页面结构，看看有哪些页面和图元。让我先查询一下。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Move widgets from page 1 to page 2\n2. Set a background image for page 2\n\nHowever, I don't have information about:\n- What pages exist (need to list pages first)\n- What widgets are on page 1\n- What background image they want\n\nLet me first list the pages to understand the current project structure."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45665, "output_tokens": 610, "latency_ms": 17092.675799969584, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前项目情况：\n- 只有 **页面1** (id: `p1`)，还没有页面2\n\n要完成您的需求，我需要几个信息：\n\n1. **页面2的配置**：\n   - 页面名称叫什么？（比如\"页面2\"）\n   - 分辨率是多少？（默认 1920×1080）\n   - 背景图是用图片URL还是背景色？（比如 `#F0F0F0` 或一个图片链接）\n\n2. **页面1上有哪些图元要迁移？**\n   - 请告诉我页面1上有哪些 widget（图元ID、类型），我好帮您在页面2上重新创建并绑定对应的点位。\n\n---\n\n另外需要说明的是，系统中没有直接的\"拖拽移动\"功能。实际操作流程是：\n1. 创建页面2\n2. 在页面2上重新创建相同的图元并绑定点位\n3. 如果确认无误，可以删除页面1上的旧图元\n\n请提供以上信息，我来帮您完成配置！", "reasoning": "OK, so there's only one page currently - page 1 (id: p1). The user wants to:\n1. Move widgets from page 1 to page 2\n2. Set a background image for page 2\n\nBut page 2 doesn't exist yet. I need to:\n1. Ask the user about page 2 details (resolution, background image URL)\n2. Find out what widgets are on page 1\n\nAlso, I don't have a direct \"move widget\" tool. Looking at the available tools, I can:\n- `create_page` - create a new page\n- `delete_widget` - remove a widget from a page\n- `create_widget` - place a widget on a page\n- `bind_point` - bind points to widgets\n\nBut there's no \"move_widget\" function. I would need to:\n1. Create page 2\n2. Get information about widgets on page 1 (but I don't see a \"list_widgets\" function either)\n3. Recreate those widgets on page 2\n4. Delete them from page 1\n\nLet me think about this... The user is asking to move widgets from page 1 to page 2. I need more information:\n1. What widgets are on page 1? (I need to ask or find a way to list them)\n2. What should the background image for page 2 be?\n\nI should ask the user for clarification on:\n1. What widgets are on page 1 that they want to move\n2. What background image they want for page 2 (URL or color)\n\nActually, let me check if there's a way to get widget information. Looking at the tools, I see `get_widget` but that's a \"Dynamic\" tool with no parameters shown. Let me ask the user for the information I need."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 91166, "output_tokens": 723, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 24297.879300022032}, "judge": null}
