d": []}, "latency_ms": 0.02989999484270811, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:f7824db982b10495c020901b33a47c6aa1d131b90e211ff92d5be6a49a659de5", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45521, "output_tokens": 579, "latency_ms": 14891.901599999983, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我来为你规划一个**反应釜综合监控方案**，分步完成：\n\n1. **新建 HMI 画面**\n2. **创建三个点位**（温度、压力、液位 — 都是模拟量）\n3. **在画面上放置控件**（罐子、温度计、压力表）\n4. **绑定点位到控件**\n5. **验证项目**\n\n---\n\n**第一步：创建画面 + 三个点位**（无依赖，并行执行）", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a comprehensive reactor monitoring solution. Let me break down the requirements:\n\n1. Create a new HMI page (画面) for reactor monitoring\n2. Create three SCADA points: temperature (温度), pressure (压力), and level (液位)\n3. Bind these points to widgets on the page (tank and instruments/gauges)\n4. Validate and deploy the project\n\nLet me start by:\n1. Creating the HMI page\n2. Creating the three points (analog type)\n3. Then create widgets and bind points\n4. Finally validate and deploy\n\nLet me start with the independent operations first - creating the page and the three points can be done in parallel."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46228, "output_tokens": 931, "latency_ms": 21990.607900021132, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "画面和三个点位全部创建成功！✅\n\n**第二步：在画面上放置控件**（罐子、温度计、压力表 + 标签）", "reasoning": "All four operations succeeded. Now I need to:\n1. Create widgets on the page - a tank for level, thermometer for temperature, and a pressure gauge for pressure\n2. Add some labels\n3. Bind the points to the widgets\n\nLet me create the widgets in parallel:\n- A tank widget for level display\n- A thermometer widget for temperature\n- A gauge/dial for pressure (I'll use a widget type that could represent a pressure gauge - let me use \"gauge\" or similar)\n- Some text labels\n\nLet me create the widgets now."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47426, "output_tokens": 303, "latency_ms": 8625.03990001278, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "7个控件全部创建成功！✅\n\n**第三步：绑定点位到控件**（点位 ↔ 控件 value 属性）", "reasoning": "All widgets created successfully. Now I need to bind the points to the widgets:\n- REACTOR_TEMP_01 → thermometer.value\n- REACTOR_LEVEL_01 → tank.value\n- REACTOR_PRESS_01 → gauge.value"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47852, "output_tokens": 52, "latency_ms": 3324.8354999814183, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "绑定完成！✅ 最后进行**项目验证**：", "reasoning": "All bindings are done. Now I need to validate the project before deploying."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47947, "output_tokens": 55, "latency_ms": 10343.204399978276, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "验证通过，零错误！✅ 现在执行**下发部署**：", "reasoning": "Validation passed with no errors. Now I can deploy the project."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 48042, "output_tokens": 520, "latency_ms": 12457.985199987888, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "部署成功！🎉\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 反应釜综合监控方案 — 全部完成\n\n### 📋 配置总览\n\n| 类别 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **HMI 画面** | `reactor_monitor` — 反应釜综合监控（1920×1080，深色背景） |\n\n### 📌 点位配置\n\n| 点位 Tag | 类型 | 单位 | 量程 | 说明 |\n|----------|------|------|------|------|\n| `REACTOR_TEMP_01` | 模拟量 | °C | 0 ~ 300 | 反应釜温度 |\n| `REACTOR_PRESS_01` | 模拟量 | MPa | 0 ~ 2.5 | 反应釜压力 |\n| `REACTOR_LEVEL_01` | 模拟量 | % | 0 ~ 100 | 反应釜液位 |\n\n### 🖥️ 画面布局\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              【反应釜综合监控】                        │\n│                                                      │\n│   🌡️ 温度计          🛢️ 储罐            ⏱️ 压力表    │\n│   therm_temp_01      tank_level_01     gauge_press_01│\n│   ← REACTOR_TEMP     ← REACTOR_LEVEL   ← REACTOR_PRESS│\n│                                                      │\n│   温度 (°C)          液位 (%)           压力 (MPa)    │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 🔗 绑定关系\n- `therm_temp_01.value` ← **REACTOR_TEMP_01**\n- `tank_level_01.value` ← **REACTOR_LEVEL_01**\n- `gauge_press_01.value` ← **REACTOR_PRESS_01**\n\n### 🚀 部署状态\n- ✅ 项目校验通过（0 错误）\n- ✅ 已成功下发到生产环境\n\n如需后续添加**报警限值**、**历史趋势**或**脚本逻辑**，随时告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All done! Let me summarize the entire configuration for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 283016, "output_tokens": 2440, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 72752.7231000131}, "judge": null}
