" (historical data), so I'll need to set up trend with scroll-back enabled\n\nBut first, I should check what points exist in the project so I know which tags to bind to the trend chart. Let me ask the user or check the existing points.\n\nActually, let me first list the existing points to see what's available, then I can proceed with creating the page and trend group.\n\nLet me call list_points first to see what tags are available."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45744, "output_tokens": 234, "latency_ms": 7925.209899956826, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中还没有任何 SCADA 点位（tags）。趋势图表需要绑定具体的点位才能显示数据。\n\n在继续之前，我需要了解以下信息：\n\n1. **你想监测哪些数据？** 例如：\n   - 温度（TEMP_xxx）\n   - 压力（PRESS_xxx）\n   - 液位（LEVEL_xxx）\n   - 流量（FLOW_xxx）\n\n2. **点位的数量和名称？** 你希望在一个趋势图上显示几条曲线？\n\n3. **页面名称？** 例如 \"趋势监控\" 或 \"Process Trends\"\n\n---\n\n或者，如果你想先用示例点位快速搭建，我可以帮你创建几个典型的模拟点位（如温度、压力、液位），然后绑定到趋势图上。你更倾向哪种方式？", "reasoning": "There are no existing points in the project. I need to let the user know and ask them what points they want to create and bind to the trend chart. Or I can create some sample points first.\n\nLet me ask the user what kind of data/tags they want to monitor on the trend chart."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 91243, "output_tokens": 442, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19836.094600032084}, "judge": null}
