\n4. Bind points to widgets\n5. Set up alarms\n\nLet me start by creating the necessary points and the HMI page. I'll need to:\n\n1. Create points:\n   - PUMP_STATION_STATUS (digital - running/stopped)\n   - PUMP_STATION_CMD (digital - start/stop command)\n   - PUMP_STATION_SPEED (analog - speed/frequency)\n   - PUMP_STATION_CURRENT (analog - motor current)\n\n2. Create an HMI page\n\n3. Add widgets\n\n4. Set up alarms\n\nLet me start with creating the points and the page simultaneously since they're independent."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46376, "output_tokens": 933, "latency_ms": 20735.941799997818, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位和页面都创建好了。现在添加控件到控制台页面：", "reasoning": "Points and page created successfully. Now I need to add widgets to the page. I'll add:\n1. A pump widget (the main visual)\n2. Start/Stop buttons\n3. Status indicators\n4. A speed display/thermometer for current\n5. Text labels\n\nLet me create the widgets now."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47515, "output_tokens": 674, "latency_ms": 15470.863699971233, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "控件都加好了。现在添加文字标签并绑定点位：", "reasoning": "All widgets created. Now I need to:\n1. Add text labels for the status lamps\n2. Bind points to widgets\n3. Create alarms\n\nLet me do text labels and bindings."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 48530, "output_tokens": 337, "latency_ms": 8553.889000031631, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "绑定全部完成！最后配置报警：", "reasoning": "All bindings done. Now I need to create the alarms:\n1. Analog alarm for high current\n2. Digital alarm for fault\n\nLet me create both alarms."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 48989, "output_tokens": 531, "latency_ms": 16892.097499978263, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部搞定！以下是完整的泵站控制台配置清单：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 配置总览\n\n### 🔖 点位（Tags）\n| 点位 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `PUMP_STATION_RUN` | 数字量 | 泵运行状态 (1=运行/0=停止) |\n| `PUMP_STATION_CMD` | 数字量 | 启停命令 (1=启动/0=停止) |\n| `PUMP_STATION_SPEED` | 模拟量 | 电机转速 (0~3000 rpm) |\n| `PUMP_STATION_CURRENT` | 模拟量 | 电机电流 (0~100 A) |\n| `PUMP_STATION_FAULT` | 数字量 | 故障信号 (1=故障) |\n\n### 🖥️ HMI 页面 — `泵站控制台`\n- **主泵图标** — 绑定运行状态，变色/动画指示\n- **绿色「启动」按钮** — 发送启动命令\n- **红色「停止」按钮** — 发送停止命令\n- **运行指示灯** — 绿色=运行，灰色=停止\n- **故障指示灯** — 红色=故障，灰色=正常\n- **转速仪表** — 实时显示电机转速\n- **电流仪表** — 实时显示电机电流\n\n### 🚨 报警配置\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 条件 | 优先级 |\n|---------|----------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_pump_current_high` | 电流 | >80A | 🔴 高 |\n| `alarm_pump_current_warn` | 电流 | >60A | 🟡 中 |\n| `alarm_pump_fault` | 故障信号 | =1 | 🔴 高 |\n| `alarm_pump_speed_high` | 转速 | >2800 或 <100 rpm | 🟡 中 |\n\n---\n\n泵站控制台已经可以用了！需要我再加点什么，比如：\n- 📈 **趋势图** 实时看转速/电流曲线？\n- 📝 **历史记录** 开启采集？\n- 📱 **报警通知** 配置短信/邮件推送？\n- 🔧 **更多泵** 加几台泵做并联控制？", "reasoning": "Everything is done. Let me summarize what was created."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 236915, "output_tokens": 3165, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 80157.14299998945}, "judge": null}
