 this out:\n\n1. First, create 11 analog points PT-100 through PT-110\n2. For each point, create 2 alarms: one for H (high) and one for HH (high-high)\n3. Enable history for each point with storage_mode=periodic and sample_interval_s=1\n\nThat's 11 points + 22 alarms + 11 history configurations = 44 tool calls total.\n\nSince creating points is independent, I can do all 11 at once. Then the alarms depend on the points existing, but since they're all independent of each other, I can batch them. Same for history configs.\n\nLet me start by creating all 11 points first. These are all independent calls.\n\nFor the points, I'll use type \"analog\". The user didn't specify units, min, max, but PT typically means pressure transmitter. I'll set reasonable defaults - but actually the user didn't specify these details. I'll just create them as analog points without specifying engineering details since the user didn't mention them.\n\nWait, let me re-read. The user said PT-100 to PT-110, which is 11 points (100, 101, 102, 103, 104, 105, 106, 107, 108, 109, 110).\n\nFor alarms, I need to specify high_limit and low_limit. The user said H and HH alarms. Typically:\n- H alarm = high limit\n- HH alarm = high-high limit\n\nBut the user didn't give specific values. I'll need to set some reasonable defaults or ask. Since the user said \"批量生成\" (batch generate), they probably want me to just proceed. I'll use reasonable default limits for pressure transmitters.\n\nActually, looking at the create_analog_alarm function, I can create alarms with just high_limit. Let me set:\n- H alarm: high_limit (I'll need a value... let me just use placeholder values like H=80, HH=90 or something reasonable)\n\nHmm, the user didn't specify the alarm limits. Let me just proceed with reasonable defaults since they want batch processing. For pressure transmitters:\n- H (High): maybe 80% of range\n- HH (High-High): maybe 90% of range\n\nI'll use generic values. Since no specific range was given, I'll just set some placeholder values. Let me use:\n- H alarm: high_limit = 80\n- HH alarm: high_limit = 90\n\nActually, I should proceed and let the user know I'm using default values that can be adjusted later.\n\nLet me first create all 11 points in one batch, then create all 22 alarms, then enable history for all 11.\n\nStarting with creating all 11 points at once since they're independent."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47187, "output_tokens": 1460, "latency_ms": 34647.74889999535, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 11 个点位全部创建成功！接下来批量创建 **H（高限）** 和 **HH（高高限）** 报警。我先用默认限值 H=80、HH=90，后续可按需调整：", "reasoning": "All 11 points created successfully. Now let me create the 22 alarms (H and HH for each point). I'll use default values:\n- H alarm: high_limit = 80\n- HH alarm: high_limit = 90\n\nThese are placeholder values - I'll let the user know they can adjust them."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 49369, "output_tokens": 580, "latency_ms": 12822.541899979115, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 22 个报警全部创建完成！最后一步，批量开启 **历史库存储**（周期模式，1秒采样）：", "reasoning": "All 22 alarms created successfully. Now I need to enable history for all 11 points with periodic sampling at 1 second interval."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 50330, "output_tokens": 261, "latency_ms": 11592.339499969967, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **全部完成！** 汇总如下：\n\n---\n\n### 📋 配置总览\n\n| 项目 | 数量 | 详情 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **点位** | 11 个 | PT-100 ~ PT-110（模拟量） |\n| **H 报警** | 11 个 | 限值 **80**，优先级 Medium |\n| **HH 报警** | 11 个 | 限值 **90**，优先级 High |\n| **历史存储** | 11 个 | 周期采样，**1秒/次** |\n\n### ⚠️ 后续可调整项\n\n- **报警限值**：当前 H=80、HH=90 为默认值，如需修改请告诉我每个点的量程和实际阈值\n- **工程单位**：点位暂未设置 unit/min/max，需要的话可以补充（如 bar、kPa 等）\n- **历史保留天数**：默认 30 天，可按需调整\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All done! Let me summarize what was accomplished."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 192412, "output_tokens": 3636, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 98562.91720003355}, "judge": null}
