output_tokens": 1673, "latency_ms": 39850.9430999984, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "这是一个批量操作，我来帮你一次性完成！需要创建 11 个点位 + 22 个报警 + 11 个历史记录配置。\n\n**方案：**\n- **点位**: PT_100 ~ PT_110，类型 analog，单位 bar，量程 0~100\n- **报警**: 每个点配 H（高报 80）和 HH（高高报 90）\n- **历史库**: 全部启用，周期采样，1 秒一次\n\n先批量创建所有点位：", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create 11 analog points: PT-100, PT-101, PT-102, ..., PT-110\n2. Each point should have H (high) and HH (high-high) alarms\n3. Enable history for all points with periodic storage mode at 1 second interval\n\nThis is a batch operation that involves creating many points, alarms, and history configurations. Let me break this down:\n\n1. First, I need to create 11 analog points (PT-100 through PT-110)\n2. Then create H and HH alarms for each point (that's 22 alarms total)\n3. Enable history for each point with periodic mode and 1 second interval\n\nSince the point creations are independent of each other, I can create all 11 points in parallel. However, the alarms depend on the points existing first, and history also depends on the points existing.\n\nLet me start by creating all 11 points at once since they're independent operations.\n\nThe user didn't specify the alarm limits, so I'll need to set reasonable defaults or ask. But since they said \"PT-100\" which sounds like pressure transmitters (压力变送器), let me just create them with some reasonable defaults. Actually, I should just create the structure and let the user adjust limits later if needed.\n\nActually, I should think about this more carefully. The user wants:\n- PT-100 to PT-110 (11 points) - these are likely pressure transmitters\n- H alarm (high) and HH alarm (high-high) for each\n- History enabled with periodic 1-second sampling\n\nSince the user didn't specify alarm limits, I'll need to use some reasonable defaults. For pressure transmitters, common ranges might be 0-100 bar or similar. \n\nI'll create all the points in parallel first, then handle the alarms and history configuration afterward since those operations depend on the points being established. For the naming convention, I'll use the format the user provided—PT_100 through PT_110—and apply sensible default alarm thresholds for each. PT-100 to PT-110 as they specified, using underscores for consistency. Now I'll create all 11 analog points in parallel, then set up the H and HH alarms for each one at reasonable pressure limits (H at 80 and HH at 90 for a 0-100 range).\n\nGenerating the point creation calls... I'm realizing that 44 parallel calls might be excessive, but the system should handle it. Looking back at the request, the user wants all points stored in the history database with periodic sampling at 1-second intervals, so I'll set retention to 30 days as the default. For the alarm thresholds on these pressure transmitters, I'll need to set reasonable H and HH limits—likely around 80 and 90 respectively for a 0-100 range, though I should confirm what makes sense for the actual transmitter specifications. I'm setting alarm thresholds at 80 for high and 90 for high-high, which represents typical engineering practice for pressure transmitters. Now I'll create all 11 points, alarms, and history configuration in parallel to generate 66 calls efficiently."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47525, "output_tokens": 1921, "latency_ms": 37795.689399994444, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 11 个点位全部创建成功！现在批量创建 H/HH 报警和启用历史库：", "reasoning": "All 11 points created successfully. Now I need to create 22 alarms (H and HH for each point) and enable history for all 11 points. Let me do all of these in parallel."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 50542, "output_tokens": 530, "latency_ms": 12423.308699973859, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **全部完成！** 33 项操作全部成功，汇总如下：\n\n---\n\n### 📊 点位创建（11 个）\n\n| 点位 Tag | 类型 | 单位 | 量程 | 描述 |\n|----------|------|------|------|------|\n| PT_100 ~ PT_110 | analog | bar | 0 ~ 100 | Pressure Transmitter |\n\n---\n\n### 🚨 报警配置（22 个）\n\n| 点位 | 报警 ID | 级别 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|------|---------|------|------|--------|\n| PT_100 | `alarm_PT_100_H` | H | 80 bar | medium |\n| PT_100 | `alarm_PT_100_HH` | HH | 90 bar | **high** |\n| PT_101 | `alarm_PT_101_H` | H | 80 bar | medium |\n| PT_101 | `alarm_PT_101_HH` | HH | 90 bar | **high** |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n| PT_110 | `alarm_PT_110_H` | H | 80 bar | medium |\n| PT_110 | `alarm_PT_110_HH` | HH | 90 bar | **high** |\n\n---\n\n### 📈 历史库配置（11 个）\n\n| 点位 | 存储模式 | 采样间隔 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|---------|------|\n| PT_100 ~ PT_110 | periodic | 1 秒 | ✅ 已启用 |\n\n---\n\n### ⚙️ 默认参数说明（可按需调整）\n- **H 报警阈值**: 80 bar（高报）\n- **HH 报警阈值**: 90 bar（高高报）\n- **历史保留天数**: 30 天（默认）\n\n如需调整报警限值、报警死区、或历史保留天数，随时告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All done! All 33 operations completed successfully:\n- 11 points created\n- 22 alarms created (H + HH for each point)\n- 11 history configs enabled\n\nLet me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 143593, "output_tokens": 4124, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 90490.81059999298}, "judge": null}
