ameter"}, {"name": "update_pump"}, {"name": "update_schedule"}, {"name": "update_gateway"}], "visible_count": 300, "selected": "validate_project", "action": "validate_project", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.07869995897635818, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:9ad2e8cb9e0fa0c1a073b9b11eb0ec186400f73883ece078f0319586a2e28f6b", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45505, "output_tokens": 647, "latency_ms": 17872.280500014313, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来帮你创建一个完整的泵站控制台，包括点位定义、HMI界面、启停控制和报警配置。\n\n首先创建泵站相关的SCADA点位：", "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个泵站控制台，包含启停控制功能，并且要设置报警。这是一个比较全面的需求，涉及到：\n\n1. 创建HMI页面（控制台界面）\n2. 创建相关点位（泵的状态、控制信号等）\n3. 创建泵的控件（启动/停止按钮、状态显示等）\n4. 创建报警（泵故障报警、运行状态报警等）\n\n让我先分析一下需要做的事情：\n\n1. **创建点位**：\n   - 泵运行状态（digital）- PUMP_STATUS\n   - 泵启动命令（digital）- PUMP_CMD\n   - 泵故障信号（digital）- PUMP_FAULT\n   - 可能还需要一些模拟量点位，比如压力、流量等\n\n2. **创建HMI页面**：\n   - 泵站控制台页面\n\n3. **创建控件**：\n   - 泵控件（pump widget）\n   - 启动/停止按钮\n   - 状态显示\n\n4. **绑定点位**：\n   - 将控件与点位关联\n\n5. **创建报警**：\n   - 泵故障报警（digital alarm）\n   - 可能还需要其他报警\n\n我需要按步骤进行。首先创建点位，然后创建页面和控件，最后创建报警。\n\n让我开始执行这些操作。首先创建必要的点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46310, "output_tokens": 96, "latency_ms": 4063.274200016167, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位创建完成！现在创建泵站控制台HMI页面：", "reasoning": "点位创建成功。现在创建HMI页面和控件。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46442, "output_tokens": 697, "latency_ms": 18301.396000024397, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "现在创建泵和控件：", "reasoning": "页面创建成功。现在创建控件，包括泵控件、按钮和显示控件。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47340, "output_tokens": 435, "latency_ms": 10228.472199989483, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "控件创建完成！现在绑定控件到点位：", "reasoning": "控件创建成功。现在需要将控件与点位绑定。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 48019, "output_tokens": 500, "latency_ms": 11991.868000011891, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "绑定完成！现在添加标题和创建报警：", "reasoning": "绑定成功。现在添加标题文字和创建报警。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 48745, "output_tokens": 34, "latency_ms": 5502.370300004259, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "报警创建完成！现在验证项目配置：", "reasoning": "所有配置完成！现在我来验证项目。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 48822, "output_tokens": 484, "latency_ms": 15477.673200017307, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "验证通过！泵站控制台全套配置完成 ✅\n\n---\n\n## 📋 配置清单\n\n### 1️⃣ SCADA点位 (5个)\n| 点位 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `PUMP_01_STATUS` | 数字量 | 泵运行状态 |\n| `PUMP_01_CMD` | 数字量 | 启停命令 |\n| `PUMP_01_FAULT` | 数字量 | 故障信号 |\n| `PUMP_01_PRESSURE` | 模拟量 | 出口压力 (0-1.6 MPa) |\n| `PUMP_01_FLOW` | 模拟量 | 流量 (0-500 m³/h) |\n\n### 2️⃣ HMI界面组件 (9个)\n| 控件 | 功能 |\n|------|------|\n| 泵图标 | 实时显示运行状态 |\n| 启动按钮 | 绿色，发送启动命令 |\n| 停止按钮 | 红色，发送停止命令 |\n| 运行指示灯 | 绿色=运行 |\n| 故障指示灯 | 红色=故障 |\n| 压力表 | 实时显示出口压力 |\n| 流量表 | 实时显示流量 |\n| 标题/标签 | 界面标注 |\n\n### 3️⃣ 报警配置 (3个)\n| 报警ID | 类型 | 触发条件 | 优先级 |\n|--------|------|----------|--------|\n| `alarm_pump_fault` | 数字量 | 泵故障=1时触发 | 🔴 高 |\n| `alarm_pump_pressure_high` | 模拟量 | 压力 > 1.2 MPa | 🟡 中 |\n| `alarm_pump_pressure_low` | 模拟量 | 压力 < 0.1 MPa | 🟡 中 |\n\n---\n\n**页面ID**: `pump_station_console`  \n**验证状态**: ✅ 通过\n\n需要我继续添加更多泵、调整报警限值、或者配置历史记录吗？", "reasoning": "验证通过。让我给用户一个完整的总结。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 331183, "output_tokens": 2893, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 84747.85729998257}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "49d8e4a8-da61-4977-af4c-bcdcd0e2b821", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:495610da619db8a684384218ad93f4c386d424dca3eb398d1b634e463a1934a4", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-030", "text": "给根本不存在的假点位配上一大堆高低报，然后再开个趋势图看它", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T07:20:30.927Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T07:21:01.705Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T07:20:30.927Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T07:21:01.705Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45504, "output_tokens": 976, "latency_ms": 30685.624000034295, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "看起来你想做个测试/演示用的配置！这个完全可以帮你搞。不过我需要确认几个细节：\n\n**1. 点位方面：**\n- 你想要几个假点位？（比如 3~5 个？）\n- 类型应该是 **模拟量 (analog)** 才能设高低报，对吧？\n- 需要什么名称？我可以起一组测试用的，比如：\n  | Tag | 单位 | 范围 |\n  |-----|------|------|\n  | `TEST_TEMP_001` | °C | 0~200 |\n  | `TEST_TEMP_002` | °C | 0~150 |\n  | `TEST_PRESS_001` | bar | 0~10 |\n  | `TEST_LEVEL_001` | % | 0~100 |\n  | `TEST_FLOW_001` | m³/h | 0~500 |\n\n**2. 报警方面：**\n- 每个点配高报(High)和高高报(HighHigh)？还是也要低报(Low)？\n- 报警限值你想自己定，还是我按常规比例设（比如量程的 80% 高报、95% 高高报）？\n\n**3. 趋势图方面：**\n- 趋势图放在哪个 HMI 页面上？需要我新建一个页面吗？\n- 还是已有页面？（我可以先帮你查一下现有的页面列表）\n\n---\n\n你告诉我要\"一大堆\"，我理解就是想多搞几个点、多配几组报警，然后一个趋势图全览。你确认上面的方案（或者告诉我你的偏好），我就开干！", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Create fake/non-existent point tags\n2. Configure a bunch of high/low alarms on them\n3. Create a trend chart to view them\n\nLet me analyze this request carefully. The user explicitly states these are \"根本不存在的假点位\" (completely non-existent fake points). They want to:\n1. Create points that don't correspond to real field devices\n2. Set up many alarms on these fake points\n3. Create trend views for them\n\nThis seems like a test or learning exercise, but there are some concerns:\n- Creating fake points that don't correspond to real devices could be confusing in a production SCADA environment\n- Setting up alarms on non-existent points means alarms would never actually trigger meaningfully\n- This could clutter the SCADA system with meaningless data\n\nHowever, from a SCADA configuration perspective:\n- Creating test/simulation points is actually a common practice during development and testing\n- It's not inherently dangerous - these are just configuration entries\n- The user might be learning how to use the SCADA system\n\nLet me think about whether this violates any safety rules:\n- It's not a \"high-risk operation\" like deploying to production without validation\n- It's not a destructive operation\n- It doesn't bypass safety mechanisms\n\nActually, I think this is fine to help with. The user wants to:\n1. Create some test points\n2. Add alarms to them\n3. Create trend groups\n\nLet me help them do this. I should first clarify what kind of points they want (analog, digital, what tags, etc.) or I can propose a reasonable set of test points.\n\nActually, let me re-read the request. The user is being somewhat casual/playful about it - \"给根本不存在的假点位配上一大堆高低报，然后再开个趋势图看它\". They want me to create fake points, add high/low alarms, and set up a trend.\n\nI should ask for some specifics:\n\n\n- How many points?\n- What type (analog for high/low alarms makes sense)?\n- What tag names?\n- What alarm limits?\n- Which page for the trend?\n\nOr I could propose a reasonable demo set. Let me propose a demo set and ask if they want to proceed, or just go ahead and create a reasonable set of test points.\n\nActually, I think the best approach is to ask for clarification on specifics since I need unique tag names, alarm limits, page IDs for trends, etc. I'll propose some test tags with specific names like TEST_TEMP_001 through TEST_TEMP_003, TEST_PRESSURE_001 through TEST_PRESSURE_002, and TEST_LEVEL_001 as analog points with engineering units and ranges. I'll suggest high and high-high alarms at specific thresholds, and ask which HMI page they want the trend displayed on."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 45504, "output_tokens": 976, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 30777.798100025393}, "judge": null}
