imo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45504, "output_tokens": 834, "latency_ms": 25338.78490002826, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来帮你创建一套演示用的假点位，配上高低报警，再开个趋势图。先创建几个典型的模拟量点位：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Create fake/non-existent points\n2. Configure a bunch of high/low alarms on them\n3. Then create a trend chart to view them\n\nThis seems like a request to create dummy/test data points and configure alarms and trends on them. This is a legitimate SCADA development task - creating test points for configuration, testing, or training purposes.\n\nLet me think about what they're actually asking:\n- They want to create points that don't exist yet (this is normal - creating new tags)\n- Add high/low alarms to these points\n- Create a trend group to visualize them\n\nThis is a standard configuration workflow. The points aren't \"fake\" in a dangerous sense - they just don't exist yet and need to be created first. This is perfectly normal SCADA configuration work.\n\nLet me proceed with this. I'll need to:\n1. Create several analog points first (since alarms and trends need real tags)\n2. Create analog alarms with high/low limits on them\n3. Create a trend group and add pens for these points\n\nBut wait - I should ask the user what kind of points they want, or I can suggest some typical ones. Let me just proceed with some reasonable examples since they seem to want me to just do it.\n\nActually, re-reading the request - \"根本不存在的假点位\" (completely non-existent fake points) - they're being a bit tongue-in-cheek about creating test/demo points. This is fine for SCADA configuration testing.\n\nLet me create some reasonable test points, alarms, and trends. I'll create a few analog points (like temperature, pressure, level, flow), add alarms, and set up a trend.\n\nLet me start by creating the points first, then I can create the alarms and trend groups in parallel after.\n\nI'll create:\n1. DEMO_TEMP_001 - Temperature (°C, 0-200)\n2. DEMO_PRESS_001 - Pressure (bar, 0-10)\n\n\n3. DEMO_LEVEL_001 - Level (%, 0-100)\n4. DEMO_FLOW_001 - Flow (m³/h, 0-500)\n\nThen create alarms for each with appropriate high/low limits, and set up a trend group. Let me start by creating all the points in parallel."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46469, "output_tokens": 1035, "latency_ms": 22797.031600028276, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "4个假点位创建完毕！现在给它们配上高低报警，同时创建趋势图：", "reasoning": "Good, all four points created successfully. Now let me create alarms for each point with high/low limits, and also create a trend group. I can do these in parallel.\n\nFor the alarms:\n- TEMP: high at 180°C, high-high at 190°C, low at 20°C\n- PRESS: high at 8 bar, low at 1 bar\n- LEVEL: high at 90%, high-high at 95%, low at 10%\n- FLOW: high at 400 m³/h, low at 50 m³/h\n\nLet me create multiple alarms for each point. I'll create:\n1. TEMP high alarm\n2. TEMP high-high alarm  \n3. TEMP low alarm\n4. PRESS high alarm\n5. PRESS low alarm\n6. LEVEL high alarm\n7. LEVEL high-high alarm\n8. LEVEL low alarm\n9. FLOW high alarm\n10. FLOW low alarm\n\nAnd create a trend group with pens for all 4 points.\n\nLet me do this in batches to not overwhelm. First batch - alarms and trend group creation."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 47838, "output_tokens": 396, "latency_ms": 14877.729700005148, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "10个报警全部创建成功！趋势图也建好了，现在把4个点位的曲线加进去：", "reasoning": "All alarms created and trend group created. Now I need to add trend pens for each of the 4 points to the trend group. I'll use different colors for each pen."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 48369, "output_tokens": 599, "latency_ms": 14905.298600031529, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "曲线加好了！再配置一下坐标轴让趋势图看起来更专业：", "reasoning": "Everything is set up. Let me now configure the trend axes to make it look nice, and enable history for the points so the trend actually has data to show."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 49220, "output_tokens": 636, "latency_ms": 15421.598099987023, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部搞定！给你汇报一下这批\"假点位\"的配置成果：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 创建的假点位（4个）\n\n| 点位标签 | 类型 | 单位 | 量程 |\n|---------|------|------|------|\n| `DEMO_TEMP_001` | 模拟量 | °C | 0~200 |\n| `DEMO_PRESS_001` | 模拟量 | bar | 0~10 |\n| `DEMO_LEVEL_001` | 模拟量 | % | 0~100 |\n| `DEMO_FLOW_001` | 模拟量 | m³/h | 0~500 |\n\n## 🚨 配置的报警（10个）\n\n| 报警ID | 监控点 | 类型 | 限值 | 优先级 |\n|--------|-------|------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_demo_temp_high` | 温度 | 高报 | 180°C | 🔴高 |\n| `alarm_demo_temp_highhigh` | 温度 | 高高报 | 195°C | 🔴高 |\n| `alarm_demo_temp_low` | 温度 | 低报 | 15°C | 🟡中 |\n| `alarm_demo_press_high` | 压力 | 高报 | 8.0 bar | 🔴高 |\n| `alarm_demo_press_low` | 压力 | 低报 | 1.0 bar | 🟡中 |\n| `alarm_demo_level_high` | 液位 | 高报 | 90% | 🔴高 |\n| `alarm_demo_level_highhigh` | 液位 | 高高报 | 95% | 🔴高 |\n| `alarm_demo_level_low` | 液位 | 低报 | 10% | 🟡中 |\n| `alarm_demo_flow_high` | 流量 | 高报 | 400 m³/h | 🟡中 |\n| `alarm_demo_flow_low` | 流量 | 低报 | 30 m³/h | 🟡中 |\n\n## 📈 趋势图配置\n\n- **趋势组名**: `DEMO_Trend_All`（1000×500）\n- **4条曲线**: 🔴温度 / 🟢压力 / 🔵液位 / 🟠流量\n- **采样间隔**: 1秒，缓冲3600点\n- **支持历史回看**: 最近1小时\n- **历史存档**: 已开启，保留30天\n\n---\n\n虽然这些点位现在还是\"空气\"（没接真实设备），但报警和趋势图已经万事俱备，随时可以用来测试或演示了！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Everything is configured. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 237400, "output_tokens": 3500, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 93928.52339998353}, "judge": null}
