 digital command point called \"PUMP_A_CMD\" for pump A start/stop control. This is a digital (boolean) point used for commanding the pump.\n\nI should use the create_point tool to create this digital point. Since it's a command point (not a status point), I'll set appropriate parameters:\n- tag: PUMP_A_CMD\n- type: digital\n- description: something about pump A start/stop control\n\nLet me create this point."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45721, "output_tokens": 185, "latency_ms": 7379.191399959382, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 数字量命令点已成功创建：\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **标签名** | PUMP_A_CMD |\n| **类型** | 数字量 (digital) |\n| **说明** | 泵A启停控制命令点（0=停止, 1=启动） |\n\n该命令点现在可用于：\n- **HMI 页面绑定**：绑定到按钮或开关控件，供操作员远程启停泵A\n- **脚本控制**：在自动化脚本中读写该点实现联锁逻辑\n- **报警配置**：如需对命令异常状态进行监控，可后续添加报警\n\n如需进一步配置（如绑定到HMI界面、添加状态反馈点或配置相关报警），请告诉我。", "reasoning": "The point was created successfully. Let me provide a clear summary to the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 91222, "output_tokens": 370, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16195.351600006688}, "judge": null}
