 wants to create a new digital command point (tag) named \"PUMP_A_CMD\" for controlling pump A start/stop.\n\nThis is a digital point (boolean - on/off for pump start/stop control). I should use the `create_point` function with:\n- tag: \"PUMP_A_CMD\"\n- type: \"digital\"\n- description: Something about pump A start/stop control\n\nLet me create this point."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45674, "output_tokens": 165, "latency_ms": 7099.559599999338, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已成功创建数字量命令点，配置信息如下：\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **标签名** | `PUMP_A_CMD` |\n| **类型** | Digital（数字量） |\n| **用途** | 泵A启停控制命令点 |\n\n该点位已就绪，可用于：\n- 在 HMI 页面上绑定启停按钮控件\n- 通过脚本或逻辑控制泵A的启动（TRUE）和停止（FALSE）\n- 关联到实际的输出通道驱动泵A设备\n\n如需进一步配置（如绑定到 HMI 控件、添加互锁脚本或关联设备），请告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The point was created successfully. Let me provide a summary to the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 91175, "output_tokens": 303, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14434.813099971507}, "judge": null}
