 was created. Now I need to bind the two points to the widget properties."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46349, "output_tokens": 174, "latency_ms": 10518.303999968339, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置完成！** 已在 `pump_panel`（泵面板）画面完成以下操作：\n\n| 操作 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **图元** | `pump_a`（泵），位置 (200, 200)，尺寸 160×160 |\n| **运行状态绑定** | `pump_a.status` ← `PUMP_A_RUN`（数字量） |\n| **频率绑定** | `pump_a.frequency` ← `PUMP_A_HZ`（模拟量，Hz） |\n\n图元已就位，运行时将实时显示泵A的运行状态和频率数据。如需调整位置、样式或添加更多绑定，请告知。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All tasks completed successfully. Let me summarize what was done."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 183819, "output_tokens": 751, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 42149.15300003486}, "judge": null}
