re (温度)\n- PT_01 → pressure (压力)\n\nI'll bind all three at once since they're independent operations."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46334, "output_tokens": 188, "latency_ms": 6320.560100022703, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部完成！以下是配置汇总：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面** | `chem_panel`（化工面板） |\n| **罐体** | `tank_01`，位于 (300, 150)，尺寸 200×350 |\n| **液位绑定** | `tank_01.level` ← `LT_01` |\n| **温度绑定** | `tank_01.temperature` ← `TT_01` |\n| **压力绑定** | `tank_01.pressure` ← `PT_01` |\n\n罐体已在化工面板上创建并绑定了三个测量点，运行时将实时显示液位、温度和压力数据。如需调整罐体样式或添加报警配置，请告诉我。", "reasoning": "All three bindings were successful. Let me summarize what was done."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 183554, "output_tokens": 810, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 32726.591200043913}, "judge": null}
