e pump's running status to the SCADA point \"PUMP_A_RUN\"\n3. Bind the pump's frequency to the SCADA point \"PUMP_A_HZ\"\n\nFirst, I need to check if the page \"pump_panel\" exists. Let me list the pages to find it.\n\nThen I'll need to create the widget and bind the points to it.\n\nLet me start by listing the pages to find the page_id for \"pump_panel\"."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45726, "output_tokens": 168, "latency_ms": 3866.9132000068203, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面存在，现在创建泵图元并绑定点位：", "reasoning": "Good, the page \"pump_panel\" exists with name \"泵面板\". Now I need to:\n1. Create a pump widget on this page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the pump's status/running property\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the pump's frequency property\n\nLet me create the pump widget first. I'll use a reasonable position and size."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45929, "output_tokens": 136, "latency_ms": 3975.7595999981277, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "Good, the pump widget was created. Now I need to bind the points to it. Let me bind both properties."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46137, "output_tokens": 171, "latency_ms": 86972.03240002273, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已完成！泵A图元已添加到 **pump_panel** 画面并完成点位绑定：\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | pump_panel（泵面板） |\n| **图元ID** | pump_a |\n| **图元类型** | pump |\n| **位置** | (100, 100) |\n| **尺寸** | 120 × 120 |\n\n**绑定关系：**\n- `pump_a.status` ← **PUMP_A_RUN** （运行状态）\n- `pump_a.frequency` ← **PUMP_A_HZ** （频率）\n\n如需调整图元位置、尺寸或样式，随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "Both bindings were successful. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 183303, "output_tokens": 638, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 102937.09050002508}, "judge": null}
