6691351, "intended_entities": ["pages.chem_panel.widgets.tank_main.bindings.pressure"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.chem_panel", "pages.chem_panel.widgets.tank_main", "points.PT_01"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:6e1059cfd20dcf8e36c0f8aed83e1441104cd8e18cd4668cdb6edaa746478909", "final_hash": "sha256:797de3be656db4710a596fdde26d2ceaf6ed7fae96f84435ee93fba82741f32e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45515, "output_tokens": 109, "latency_ms": 9859.996699960902, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查看一下现有的页面，确认 `chem_panel` 页面是否存在。", "reasoning": "The user wants me to create a tank widget on the \"chem_panel\" page and bind three SCADA points to it:\n- LT_01 for level (液位)\n- TT_01 for temperature (温度)\n- PT_01 for pressure (压力)\n\nFirst, I need to check if the \"chem_panel\" page exists. Let me list the pages to find it."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45675, "output_tokens": 193, "latency_ms": 5840.837099996861, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "`chem_panel` 页面已存在。现在我来创建罐体控件，并绑定三个点位。", "reasoning": "The page \"chem_panel\" exists with the name \"化工面板\". Now I need to:\n1. Create a tank widget on this page\n2. Bind LT_01 to level (液位)\n3. Bind TT_01 to temperature (温度)\n4. Bind PT_01 to pressure (压力)\n\nLet me create the tank widget first. I'll place it at a reasonable position and size."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 45902, "output_tokens": 269, "latency_ms": 54441.63190003019, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体已创建，现在绑定三个点位：", "reasoning": "The tank widget was created. Now I need to bind the three points:\n- LT_01 → level (液位)\n- TT_01 → temperature (温度)\n- PT_01 → pressure (压力)\n\nI can make all three bind calls at once since they're independent."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 46275, "output_tokens": 178, "latency_ms": 226057.77290003607, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **已完成！** 在 `chem_panel`（化工面板）页面上成功创建罐体并完成绑定：\n\n| 控件 | 页面 | 点位绑定 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| 🛢️ **tank_main** | chem_panel | |\n\n| 属性 | 绑定点位 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| level | **LT_01** | 液位 |\n| temperature | **TT_01** | 温度 |\n| pressure | **PT_01** | 压力 |\n\n罐体位于页面坐标 (200, 150)，尺寸 200×300。运行时液位、温度和压力将实时显示在罐体控件上。", "reasoning": "All three bindings were successful. Let me summarize what was done."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 183367, "output_tokens": 749, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 296855.3866999573}, "judge": null}
