nput_tokens": 46267, "output_tokens": 163, "latency_ms": 4756.307600007858, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置完成！** 已在「化工面板」页面成功创建罐体并绑定点位：\n\n| 组件 | 属性 | 绑定点位 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| `tank_main` | 液位 (level) | LT_01 |\n| `tank_main` | 温度 (temperature) | TT_01 |\n| `tank_main` | 压力 (pressure) | PT_01 |\n\n罐体位置：(100, 150)，尺寸：300×400 像素。运行时该罐体将实时显示液位、温度和压力的数值变化。", "reasoning": "All done. The tank widget has been created and all three bindings are complete."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 183404, "output_tokens": 726, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23404.725400032476}, "judge": null}
